## RoundEndSystem

round-end-system-shuttle-called-announcement = 紧急撤离穿梭机已派出。预计到达时间：{$time} {$units}。
round-end-system-shuttle-already-called-announcement = 紧急撤离穿梭机已经派出。
round-end-system-shuttle-auto-called-announcement = 一艘自动班次交接穿梭机已派出。预计到达时间：{$time} {$units}。召回穿梭机可延长班次。
round-end-system-shuttle-recalled-announcement = 紧急撤离穿梭机已被召回。
round-end-system-shuttle-sender-announcement = 空间站
round-end-system-round-restart-eta-announcement = 将在 {$time} {$units} 后重启回合……

eta-units-minutes = 分钟
eta-units-seconds = 秒
